AF MnO - type-II AFM rock salt, rhombohedral magnetic cell
! primitive vectors given explicitly in units of the cubic lattice
! constant a = 4.445 Angstrom (a0 converts Angstrom -> bohr)
&lattice latsys='hR', a0=1.8897259886, a=5.443991, alpha=33.5573 /
! NB: 'a' above is the rhombohedral edge length a_cubic*sqrt(3/2);
! alpha = arccos(5/6) = 33.5573 deg is the ideal (undistorted) angle.
! If your inpgen build does not accept latsys='hR' with (a,alpha),
! use the explicit primitive vectors instead (in units of a_cubic=4.445):
!   a1 = (0.5, 0.5, 1.0)
!   a2 = (1.0, 0.5, 0.5)
!   a3 = (0.5, 1.0, 0.5)
4
25  0.00  0.00  0.00   ! Mn spin UP
25  0.50  0.50  0.50   ! Mn spin DOWN
8  0.25  0.25  0.25   ! O
8  0.75  0.75  0.75   ! O
